  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“That’s so typically me. I’m such a riot.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Laughter class feature, character level 5th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a swift action, you may grant yourself a number of laughs equal to your Charisma modifier. However, you may not gain laughs from any other sources for a number of rounds equal to your Charisma modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gonzo-feats#toc44\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
